            "type": "game",
            "name": "THOSE DAMN ALIENS! VR",
            "steam_appid": 573260,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/573260/extras/082fe042f425bd2d8d0e698346440575.avif?t=1540541497\" width=620 height=200 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A VIRTUAL REALITY SCI-FI SHOOTER </h2><br>Aliens have boarded your ship! Take up arms and battle waves of aliens in an attempt to save yourself in this VR wave based first person sci-fi shooter.<br><br>Living alone on space research centre X34-Zelta, you work endlessly in an attempt to find an antidote to a deadly virus that has begun spreading among the human population. Only you can stop the invasion and find a cure. <br><br>It's time to take arms, and fight back!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Campaign Mode<br></li><li>Survival Mode<br></li><li>Multiple Weapon Types<br></li><li>Online Competitive Leader Boards (coming soon)<br></li><li>Stylish Sci-Fi Interface<br></li><li>Realistic Graphics<br></li><li>Immersive Audio<br></li><li>Action-packed Game-Play</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/573260/extras/082fe042f425bd2d8d0e698346440575.avif?t=1540541497\" width=620 height=200 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A VIRTUAL REALITY SCI-FI SHOOTER </h2><br>Aliens have boarded your ship! Take up arms and battle waves of aliens in an attempt to save yourself in this VR wave based first person sci-fi shooter.<br><br>Living alone on space research centre X34-Zelta, you work endlessly in an attempt to find an antidote to a deadly virus that has begun spreading among the human population. Only you can stop the invasion and find a cure. <br><br>It's time to take arms, and fight back!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Campaign Mode<br></li><li>Survival Mode<br></li><li>Multiple Weapon Types<br></li><li>Online Competitive Leader Boards (coming soon)<br></li><li>Stylish Sci-Fi Interface<br></li><li>Realistic Graphics<br></li><li>Immersive Audio<br></li><li>Action-packed Game-Play</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "Aliens have boarded your ship; It's time to take arms and defend yourself from the incoming hive. 'Those Damn Aliens' is a VR wave based first person shooter with campaign and survival modes.",
